OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fdry evening and night across the
OL,7,Fregion with clear spells developing at
OL,8,Ftimes. However, areas of fog and frost
OL,9,Fare also likely to form, the fog
OL,10,Fbecoming most widespread and locally
OL,11,Fdense in the south.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FFog and frost will gradually
OL,14,Flift on Tuesday to leave a dry day
OL,15,Fwith some bright or sunny spells,
OL,16,Fthough cloud will start to increase
OL,17,Ffrom the southwest later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
