OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FWednesday will see fairly cloudy skies
OL,7,Fwith occasional bright spells and the
OL,8,Fodd shower. Much sunnier weather will
OL,9,Fdevelop thereafter, though turning
OL,10,Fcolder with a widespread overnight
OL,11,Ffrost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
